    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton event bus for global event dispatching. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref> allows any part of the engine to subscribe to events and be notified when they occur. It uses type-based subscription (via std::type_index) for type-safe event handling.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This is a singleton; use <ref refid="classEventBus_1abb3a69dd93dc265aec144024ab8ab3ed" kindref="member">GetInstance()</ref> to access it. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classEvent" kindref="compound">Event</ref>, <ref refid="classEventDispatcher" kindref="compound">EventDispatcher</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
